   808                              <1> .upbpFindF9:
   809                              <1> ;Reads the supposed start of the second FAT sector to search for a FF9h 
   810                              <1> ;Call with rbx -> Table entry for this drive
   811                              <1> ;Returns:   CF=NC and ZF=ZE: Second boot sector found. Use the bpb in rbx.
